#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {name}"
msgstr "Paigalda {name}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {title}"
msgstr "Paigalda {title}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"A .deb file can't go on the system. For everything to work, look for {title} as an .rpm file or in Bazaar, the app store.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a box anyway, without those parts."
msgstr ""
"Paigalda {title}\n"
"\n"
"Kastis ei toimi {title} järgmised osad:\n"
"{notes}\n"
".deb-faili ei saa süsteemi paigaldada. Selleks, et kõik töötaks, otsi {title} üles .rpm-failina või Bazaarist, mis on rakenduste pood.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: paneb selle ikkagi kasti, aga ilma nende osadeta."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"It comes from {maker}'s own download source, which is added to the system so {title} keeps updating. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"To connect, you need a {maker} account."
msgstr ""
"Paigalda {title}\n"
"\n"
"See pärineb tootja {maker} enda allalaadimisallikast, mis lisatakse süsteemi, et {title} uueneks ka edaspidi. Vajab sinu parooli ja taaskäivitust.\n"
"\n"
"Ühenduse loomiseks on vaja teenuse {maker} kontot."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Add to the system. In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"On the system, everything works. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"Or {setup}: puts it in a separate box. It's easier to remove, but those parts won't work."
msgstr ""
"Paigalda {title}\n"
"\n"
"Soovitatav: „Lisa süsteemi“. Kastis ei tööta need rakenduse {title} osad:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"Süsteemis töötab kõik. Vajab sinu parooli ja taaskäivitust.\n"
"\n"
"Või {setup}: paneb selle eraldi kasti. Seda on lihtsam eemaldada, kuid need osad ei tööta."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a separate box. Your system isn't changed, and Remove Apps takes it out cleanly."
msgstr ""
"Paigalda {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: paneb selle eraldi kasti. Sinu süsteemi ei muudeta ja „Eemalda rakendused“ eemaldab selle puhtalt."

