msgstr "Vali testitav probleem. Sinu arvuti peaks selle ise korda tegema."

msgid "Pick a test, click Start the test, and type your password."
msgstr "Vali test, klõpsa nuppu „Käivita test“ ja sisesta oma parool."

msgid "Pick an .exe or .msi to get its Linux version"
msgstr "Vali .exe- või .msi-fail, et saada selle Linuxi versioon"

msgid "Pick an .rpm or .deb file from Downloads"
msgstr "Vali kaustast Allalaadimised .rpm- või .deb-fail"

msgid "Pick an app or game so other computers can reach it"
msgstr "Vali rakendus või mäng, et teised arvutid saaksid sellele ligi"

msgid "Pick it again in Get a VPN."
msgstr "Vali see uuesti jaotises „Hangi VPN“."

msgid "Pick one."
msgstr "Vali üks."

msgid "Pick the app for the web, mail, calendar, music, videos and photos."
msgstr ""
"Vali rakendus veebi, meili, kalendri, muusika, videote ja fotode jaoks."

msgid ""
"Pick the app. To use it every time for that kind of file, turn on Always use "
"for this file type first."
msgstr ""
"Vali rakendus. Kui soovid seda alati seda tüüpi failide puhul kasutada, "
"lülita esmalt sisse valik „Always use for this file type“ (kasuta alati selle"
" failitüübi jaoks)."

msgid ""
"Pick the box. It's set up again, with its apps. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Vali kast. See seadistatakse uuesti koos oma rakendustega. Sinu faile ei "
"puudutata."

msgid "Pick the day. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Vali päev. „Tagasi“ jätab selle muutmata."

msgid ""
"Pick the folder, then how often it changes: every hour, every day or at each "
