msgid "That folder is already shared, as {name}."
msgstr "See kaust on juba jagatud nimega {name}."

msgid "That folder isn't shared."
msgstr "See kaust ei ole jagatud."

msgid "That folder wasn't found."
msgstr "Seda kausta ei leitud."

msgid "That folder's name can't be shared. Rename it or pick another."
msgstr "Selle kausta nime ei saa jagada. Nimeta see ümber või vali mõni teine."

msgid "That isn't let in here."
msgstr "Seda ei ole siin sisse lastud."

msgid "That isn't the disk password, so nothing was changed. Try again."
msgstr "See ei ole kettaparool, nii et midagi ei muudetud. Proovi uuesti."

msgid ""
"That was the wrong disk password too many times, so it's locked for an hour. "
"Nothing was changed. Try again after that."
msgstr ""
"Kettaparool sisestati liiga palju kordi valesti, nii et see on tunniks "
"lukustatud. Midagi ei muudetud. Proovi pärast seda uuesti."

msgid ""
"The BIOS screen uses the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or"
" Exit."
msgstr ""
"BIOS-i kuva kasutatakse klaviatuuriga. Kui oled lõpetanud, vali Save and Exit"
" või Exit."

msgid ""
"The BIOS's RAID setting (Intel RST) hides the disk. Restart into the BIOS and"
" set the storage mode (often called SATA mode or SATA operation) to AHCI. "
"Windows on this disk won't start after that change, but installing EvenKeelOS"
" erases it anyway."
msgstr ""
"BIOS-i RAID-säte (Intel RST) peidab ketta. Taaskäivita arvuti BIOS-i ja määra"
" salvestusrežiimiks (sageli nimega SATA mode või SATA operation) AHCI. Pärast"
" seda muudatust ei käivitu sellel kettal olev Windows, kuid EvenKeelOS-i "
"paigaldamine kustutab selle niikuinii."

msgid "The Bluetooth driver is blocked, so there's no Bluetooth."
msgstr "Bluetoothi draiver on blokeeritud, seega Bluetoothi ei ole."

msgid ""
"The NVIDIA card runs on the open-source driver built into EvenKeelOS. The "
"proprietary NVIDIA driver isn't used: it breaks too often to keep the promise"
" that EvenKeelOS just works. If you need it, use Bazzite or Bluefin's NVIDIA "
"editions instead."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA kaart töötab EvenKeelOS-i sisseehitatud avatud lähtekoodiga "
"draiveriga. NVIDIA suletud lähtekoodiga draiverit ei kasutata: see läheb "
"liiga tihti katki, et pidada lubadust, et EvenKeelOS lihtsalt töötab. Kui sul"
" on seda vaja, kasuta selle asemel Bazzite'i või Bluefini NVIDIA-väljaandeid."

msgid "The QR code could not be made. Save the log to a stick instead."
msgstr "QR-koodi ei saanud luua. Salvesta logi selle asemel mälupulgale."

msgid "The USB stick could not be opened."
msgstr "USB-mälupulka ei saanud avada."

msgid "The VPN list is missing."
msgstr "VPN-i loend puudub."

msgid "The Wi-Fi card's driver is blocked, so there's no Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Wi-Fi-kaardi draiver on blokeeritud, mistõttu Wi-Fi puudub."

